# Tables & Database Metadata API Requests
# Note: In production mode (NODE_ENV=production), these routes return 404 Route not found.

@host = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. Get Overall Database & Tables Summary
GET {{host}}/tables/summary
Accept: application/json

### 2. List All Tables (All User Base Tables)
GET {{host}}/tables
Accept: application/json

### 3. Search Tables by Name Filter (?search=task)
GET {{host}}/tables?search=task
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get Table Details & Schema (Columns, Data Types, Primary Keys)
GET {{host}}/tables/task
Accept: application/json

### 5. Fetch Paginated Records from Table (Page 1, Limit 10, Sorted)
GET {{host}}/tables/task/data?page=1&limit=10&sort_by=created_at&order=desc
Accept: application/json
